@startuml activity-create-category
' Create category: an admin adds a category from the dashboard.
' Precondition: the admin is signed in.

title Create category

|Admin|
start
:1 · Open Manage Categories;
:2 · Click Add category;
' The repeat start is the merge: step 3 is reached from step 2 or after an error.
repeat :3 · Enter the category name;
  :4 · Click Create category;

  |Coffee Shop System|
  :Check the name\n(required, length rules);
  if (Name valid?) then ([yes])
    :Look up the name\n(deleted categories too);
    if (Name already used?) then ([no])
      :Save the category;
    else ([yes])
    endif
  else ([no])
  endif

backward :Show the error\nunder the name field;
repeat while (Name rejected?) is ([yes]) not ([no])

:Show "Category created";
:Open the categories list;
stop

@enduml
